# Trystan's Command, modes 2 and 3: "Return one or two target permanent cards from your graveyard to your hand" and "Destroy target
# creature or enchantment." Bot1's graveyard holds a Black Lotus (sacrificed for mana on turn 1) and a Llanowar Elves (killed by Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt), both permanent cards; Bot2's Lightning Bolt in its own graveyard is not a legal target (not "your graveyard", and no
# permanent card). Bot1 returns the Lotus and the Elves to its hand and destroys Bot2's Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Sol Ring
Mox Pearl
Trystan's Command
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Island x17

